    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/62e076cb43fec81158d6d6480b2aa7c4.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=80 /></span>Embark on an adventure and conquer mighty kingdoms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Castle Crumble, your goal is clear\u2014castles must fall. Fulfill the dream of reducing towering fortresses to dust in a fully simulated physics environment. Could destruction be relaxing? In Castle Crumble it can!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/1206905538a6f28c419103c0f31f67f3.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/d84e5ad6910bcebac7113057db80e39e.poster.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/d84e5ad6910bcebac7113057db80e39e.webm?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/d84e5ad6910bcebac7113057db80e39e.mp4?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of tools to bring down castles in different ways. For even greater firepower, equip boosters and unleash true destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/62e076cb43fec81158d6d6480b2aa7c4.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/a12a64d19d01e41089964a76e80fb67f.poster.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/a12a64d19d01e41089964a76e80fb67f.webm?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/a12a64d19d01e41089964a76e80fb67f.mp4?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move counts. Use your limited ammo wisely, set up chain reactions, and watch as multi-staged castles crumble before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/05a312b032d9f1b0d71622c2545b2c55.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/1e11be2c5c878e0d50cd4a371a6af4e8.poster.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/1e11be2c5c878e0d50cd4a371a6af4e8.webm?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/1e11be2c5c878e0d50cd4a371a6af4e8.mp4?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each brick and wooden beam is individually simulated, allowing for dynamic and unpredictable destruction. Knock towers onto other buildings or trigger placed explosives with flying rubble for spectacular results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/41840b543e786ef7f7a6e2f89aa18adf.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/10cc0d157295d2ffe1af04a3e6913e1f.poster.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/10cc0d157295d2ffe1af04a3e6913e1f.webm?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/10cc0d157295d2ffe1af04a3e6913e1f.mp4?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Castle Crumble, featuring unique and beautiful landscapes. From dense jungles to scorching deserts and serene coastal islands, each kingdom offers new challenges to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to strategize, demolish, and conquer in Castle Crumble\u2014where every collapse is a victory!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/62e076cb43fec81158d6d6480b2aa7c4.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=80 /></span>Embark on an adventure and conquer mighty kingdoms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Castle Crumble, your goal is clear\u2014castles must fall. Fulfill the dream of reducing towering fortresses to dust in a fully simulated physics environment. Could destruction be relaxing? In Castle Crumble it can!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/1206905538a6f28c419103c0f31f67f3.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/d84e5ad6910bcebac7113057db80e39e.poster.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/d84e5ad6910bcebac7113057db80e39e.webm?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/d84e5ad6910bcebac7113057db80e39e.mp4?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of tools to bring down castles in different ways. For even greater firepower, equip boosters and unleash true destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/62e076cb43fec81158d6d6480b2aa7c4.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/a12a64d19d01e41089964a76e80fb67f.poster.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/a12a64d19d01e41089964a76e80fb67f.webm?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/a12a64d19d01e41089964a76e80fb67f.mp4?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move counts. Use your limited ammo wisely, set up chain reactions, and watch as multi-staged castles crumble before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/05a312b032d9f1b0d71622c2545b2c55.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/1e11be2c5c878e0d50cd4a371a6af4e8.poster.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/1e11be2c5c878e0d50cd4a371a6af4e8.webm?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/1e11be2c5c878e0d50cd4a371a6af4e8.mp4?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each brick and wooden beam is individually simulated, allowing for dynamic and unpredictable destruction. Knock towers onto other buildings or trigger placed explosives with flying rubble for spectacular results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/41840b543e786ef7f7a6e2f89aa18adf.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/10cc0d157295d2ffe1af04a3e6913e1f.poster.avif?t=1750402081\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/10cc0d157295d2ffe1af04a3e6913e1f.webm?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/10cc0d157295d2ffe1af04a3e6913e1f.mp4?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Castle Crumble, featuring unique and beautiful landscapes. From dense jungles to scorching deserts and serene coastal islands, each kingdom offers new challenges to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to strategize, demolish, and conquer in Castle Crumble\u2014where every collapse is a victory!</p>",
